cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this plugin, please cite it as below. Please also cite the method paper listed in the references."
type: software
title: "Coastline Dynamics: a QGIS plugin for annual shorelines and rates of coastal change"
abstract: "A QGIS plugin that maps the shoreline of every year from Landsat and Sentinel-2 time series and computes rates of coastal change, following the DEA Coastlines method."
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
url: "https://github.com/EvgenieLebedev/coastline_dynamics"
repository-code: "https://github.com/EvgenieLebedev/coastline_dynamics"
authors:
